Kind: widen
Issue: #904
Holds open: the window between a writer taking the slot at prod_tail and publishing it -- 1 ms of thread_switch(SWITCH_OPTION_WAIT) after the copy and before flipc2_produce_commit(), so that a second writer of the pipe arrives while the first still holds the slot, on one processor as on four; with the fix the second waits on the writers' lock.  Without it, 904-no-writers-lock was caught 3 of 4 at d9e0402c on OMEGA: in one KVM boot at -smp 4 the two writers of musl_test's [33] never overlapped.  Only musl_test uses a pipe in a boot, so nothing else meets the delay
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4

